{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLIP WAVE is an ultra-minimalist tactical simulation game!</strong><br>Amid endless sieges, manage firepower and aggro, take down more enemies, survive longer, and aim for a high score!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Only 2 Player Units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/ceb501726ca2749fdac3a65051bc79c5.webp?t=1748333979\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Melee Unit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick to recover and draws enemy attention when charging into them.<br>Rush in as a group and crush your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/01759e9673ef042113e7b3c4816d3af7.webp?t=1748333979\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Ranged Unit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fires explosive rounds to chip away at enemy groups' endurance.<br>But they\u2019re fragile\u2014stay on the move, work together, and neutralize enemy squads!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/333df203d06078dd06a3b498a5b8e2c2.webp?t=1748333979\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Clear the Battlefield with Bombs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your power meter fills up, you can unleash a bomb to wipe out enemies.<br>Will you save it for the perfect moment, or use it before things get risky?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/183bdde63c4b6be9735a7b2cc54acba9.webp?t=1748333979\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Enemies Don\u2019t Heal, But...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep one unit alive long enough to charge your bomb power?<br>Sometimes enemies will stop and switch to long-range mode. If you don\u2019t take them out, the battlefield becomes a bullet hell\u2014and you're on the ropes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699520/extras/65536d7d5e5871dda044b55d9713d7d9.webp?t=1748333979\" width=32 height=32 /></span>It's Intense!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s a limited-time slow-motion ability to help manage the chaos.<br>With clever use of shortcuts and filters, you might issue faster, sharper commands!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ripples","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699520/5520b45ea702dcffcfd7acfc53627ceef6ab0ec4.jpg"},{"name":"Surf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699520/eff75d745f7f6d366937e213c4afd03c9366cebf.jpg"},{"name":"Big wave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699520/5c1b712ae6e99cfb4b67e6f7393fd9e91bd4c9b4.jpg"},{"name":"Billow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699520/0f0e5811e3fb366a80c60bd05b56fd2e0370d782.jpg"},{"name":"Tidal wave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699520/afc7eb66e007ef8c3bde88b3b8138a01d8607a57.jpg"},{"name":"Deep impact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699520/2ef1393b8258cbd2e7bb4b7e395c7bf87076d6ae.jpg"},{"name":"Battalion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699520/25a956f6f9d78709511373de41740313f5438c10.jpg"},{"name":"Regiment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699520/3f60575f8328296301a1fe2e79ab73e9b1760457.jpg"},{"name":"Brigade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699520/7d83d91524beeea1799684d8f91638553a